{"id":"wb-4-167","name":"万荣后土庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"万荣后土庙","text":"汾阴后土祠俗称后土祠，因所在地今亦称万荣后土祠，位于今中国山西省运城市万荣县荣河镇庙前村，汾河南岸、黄河东岸，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。汾阴后土祠为汉武帝所确立的皇帝祭地的本庙，汉、唐、宋多位皇帝曾在此亲祀后土。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E8%8D%A3%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%9F%E5%BA%99","revisionId":85848765,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85848765","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/728dbb99aa58b2522e351c02.jpg","title":"Qiufeng_Tower_in_Wanrong_Houtu_Temple_03_2013-09.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qiufeng_Tower_in_Wanrong_Houtu_Temple_03_2013-09.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/Qiufeng_Tower_in_Wanrong_Houtu_Temple_03_2013-09.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​万荣后土祠秋风楼，侧面。","width":320,"height":427}}